# A paste whose end marker shares a read with Enter. One `type` carries all
# of it, so it lands in one read: fx v0.0.16 keeps the paste, drops the Enter
# and warns (9e0eab41; `input_paste_runtime.zig:168-198@481104fd`). Phase 4's
# X1 scenario, from when xfx followed c1db919 and refused the paste; the
# keystrokes are `p5-input-paste.cap`'s byte for byte.
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
wait 4
type prior
wait 0.5
type [200~new[201~
wait 1.5
snap paste-enter
snapfull paste-enter
gwlog
